To round $563.5097$ to the nearest hundredth, we look at the digit in the hundredths place (the second digit to the right of the decimal point). 

The digit in the hundredths place is $5$, which is $5$ or more, so we round $563.5097$ up to $563.51$.

\boxed{563.51}

Since \( f(x) \) is an even function, it satisfies the property \( f(x) = f(-x) \). Given that the graph passes through the point \((-4, -7)\), by the even property, it must also pass through the point \((4, -7)\).

Thus, the other point that the graph of \( y = f(x) \) must pass through is \((4, -7)\).

\boxed{(4, -7)}
